      "canonical_claim": "Each Jostle check uses the current shared Strained Inventory fill proportion: chance equals 50% multiplied by current Strained Cargo divided by maximum Strained capacity. Full capacity is 50% per check regardless of whether maximum capacity is 10, 20, or 30; half capacity is 25%; at empty capacity the procedure ceases to apply. The probability is recalculated as the fill level changes.",
